    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11508" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">crĕātūra</span></b> ,
		ae, f.
		creo, only concr., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a creature, thing created</i> (late Lat.),
					<i><span class="en">Tert. Apol. 30</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Prud. Ham. 508</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">omnes creaturae tuae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg. Tob. 8, 7</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>The creation</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Deus caelorum et Dominus totius creaturae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Jud. 9, 17</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Dei,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Apoc. 3, 14 al.</span></i>
			</div>
